==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07~6 seconds<sup>2f~180f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 20~33.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 2~10 seconds<sup>60f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 160 seconds<sup>4,800f</sup>, delay 20~33.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Monkey King (Enemy)|Monkey King]] (3,000%) spawns as the boss.
*2 [[Monkey King (Enemy)|Monkey Kings]] (3,000%) spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Monkey King (Enemy)|Monkey Kings]] (3,500%) spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] is a great unit to bring here as it can both out range Monkey King, and deal with the Gories extremely well. Otherwise, just get units that have higher range than Monkey King and you'll win easily.

